<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - International Specialty started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - International Specialty started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Chris Bodnar said he started International Specialty Products Inc as a buy and set a 12-month target price of $16.</p>
<p>-- He estimated the company would earn $0.82 during 1996 and $0.92 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
